# Third-party pretrained tokenizer files fetched from Hugging Face
# (facebook/nllb-200-distilled-600M is CC-BY-NC-4.0; redistribution rights
# are unresolved, so only the small provenance manifest -- revision, file
# hashes -- is tracked, matching this project's existing OCR-source policy).
experiments/expanded_morphology_v4/resources/nllb-tokenizer/

# Bulk raw PLD parse (22 MB, 114k rows, derived from the 48 GB Philippine
# Languages Database archive; redistribution rights unresolved). Only the
# provenance-manifest.json (which records its SHA-256) is tracked, same
# policy as the NLLB tokenizer above. The small curated derivatives
# (pld_prompt_inventory_*, candidate/verified pair CSVs) are kept.
experiments/parallel_extraction_*/resources/pld_prompt_entries_pam_fil.csv
